---
description: Boundaries for background and cloud agents
alwaysApply: true
---

If you are running as a background or cloud agent, you open pull requests. You never merge
and never push to `main`.

Never modify: `api/src/px/analytics/**`, `api/src/px/extract/prompts/**`,
`api/src/px/narrate/prompts/**`, `fixtures/metrics.sample.json`, `docs/SPEC.md`.
A PR touching those paths is closed unread. If a task appears to require it, open an issue
labelled `blocked-needs-human` and move to the next ready task.

One issue, one PR. CI green or convert to draft. Append decisions to `docs/DECISIONS.md`
in the same PR.
